    show{ n = get_n{ s }, z = twice{ &s } }  //~ error at 27: `n` reads `s.n`, which `z` changes, in one call: the order of the fields would decide what it reads; compute one of them in a `let` before the call //~ note at 22: `n` reads `s.n` here //~ note at 38: `z` changes `s.n` here
}
